# Top-level formulae deliberately left unmanaged: one-offs and build leftovers
# that a rebuilt machine does not need. One name per line.
#
# A check that warns forever trains you to ignore it, so anything genuinely
# not worth manifesting belongs here rather than in a Brewfile.
ragel        # build-time dep left behind by something compiled from source
youtubedr    # one-off downloader; yt-dlp is the manifested one
